{
  "_comment": "Caption style presets. Colors are hex (#RRGGBB). 'strokeColor'/'strokeWidth' = the text outline (e.g. black stroke). 'position' is one of top|center|bottom. Sizes/paddings are in pixels relative to a 1080x1920 canvas. English presets: hormozi, tiktok, minimal. Hindi/Devanagari presets: hindi, hindi-minimal (use the 'Noto Sans Devanagari' font). The active preset is chosen automatically by LANGUAGE (captions.byLanguage in default.json); override with captions.activeStyle or the CAPTION_STYLE env var. Any preset may add an 'animation' object to override the global default in default.json, e.g. \"animation\": { \"enter\": \"fade\", \"exit\": \"none\" } (enter/exit: pop|fade|slide|none).",

